{"zh":[{"start":0.63,"end":2.7,"text":"你会在哪里"},{"start":2.7,"end":6.44,"text":"观看 2023 年和 2024 年美国的日食？"},{"start":7.31,"end":9.31,"text":"NASA 发布了"},{"start":9.31,"end":11.24,"text":"一张新地图，"},{"start":11.24,"end":12.95,"text":"可以帮你做决定。"},{"start":13.58,"end":21.39,"text":"环食和全食的路径在美国地图上显示为深色条带。"},{"start":22.05,"end":30.7,"text":"从俄勒冈到得克萨斯，在环食路径上的人，都有机会在 2023 年 10 月 14 日看到日环食。"},{"start":31.3,"end":37.24,"text":"从得克萨斯到缅因，在全食路径上的人，都有机会在 2024 年 4 月 8 日看到日全食。"},{"start":38.1,"end":47.81,"text":"深色路径里有一个个椭圆，里面写着时间。在椭圆里的人会在那个时间看到环食或全食。"},{"start":48.62,"end":55.79,"text":"每条路径里有白线，表示环食或全食会持续多久。"},{"start":56.66,"end":66.7,"text":"在路径之外的地方，与路径平行的黄线和紫线表示太阳会被月亮遮住多少。"},{"start":67.93,"end":74.51,"text":"这些路径一直延伸到地图边缘，那里能找到偏食的百分比。"},{"start":75.14,"end":82.15,"text":"环食线的百分比标在地图的左边和上边。"},{"start":83.12,"end":90.49,"text":"全食的百分比标在地图的下边和右边。"},{"start":91.42,"end":102.53,"text":"一个地球仪显示完整的日食路径，阴影带表示哪里能看到偏食。"}],"de":[],"en":[{"start":0.63,"end":2.7,"text":"Where will you be","words":[["Where","哪里"],["will","会"],["you","你"],["be","在"]]},{"start":2.7,"end":6.44,"text":"for the 2023 and 2024 solar eclipses in the United States?","words":[["for","为了"],["the","这"],["2023","2023"],["and","和"],["2024","2024"],["solar","日"],["eclipses","食"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["United","美国"],["States?","国"]]},{"start":7.31,"end":9.31,"text":"NASA has released","words":[["NASA","NASA"],["has","已"],["released","发布"]]},{"start":9.31,"end":11.24,"text":"a new map","words":[["a","一张"],["new","新"],["map","地图"]]},{"start":11.24,"end":12.95,"text":"that could help you decide.","words":[["that","那"],["could","能"],["help","帮"],["you","你"],["decide.","决定"]]},{"start":13.58,"end":21.39,"text":"The paths for the annular eclipse and total eclipse appear as dark bands across the U.S.","words":[["The","这"],["paths","路径"],["for","为"],["the","这"],["annular","环"],["eclipse","食"],["and","和"],["total","全"],["eclipse","食"],["appear","显示"],["as","作为"],["dark","深色"],["bands","条带"],["across","横跨"],["the","这"],["U.S.","美国"]]},{"start":22.05,"end":30.7,"text":"Anyone located in the annular eclipse path, from Oregon to Texas, will have a chance to see the annular eclipse on October 14, 2023.","words":[["Anyone","任何人"],["located","位于"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["annular","环"],["eclipse","食"],["path,","路径"],["from","从"],["Oregon","俄勒冈"],["to","到"],["Texas,","得克萨斯"],["will","将"],["have","有"],["a","一个"],["chance","机会"],["to","去"],["see","看"],["the","这"],["annular","环"],["eclipse","食"],["on","在"],["October","十月"],["14,","14"],["2023.","2023年"]]},{"start":31.3,"end":37.24,"text":"Anyone located in the total eclipse path, from Texas to Maine, will have a chance to see the total eclipse, on April 8, 2024.","words":[["Anyone","任何人"],["located","位于"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["total","全"],["eclipse","食"],["path,","路径"],["from","从"],["Texas","得克萨斯"],["to","到"],["Maine,","缅因"],["will","将"],["have","有"],["a","一个"],["chance","机会"],["to","去"],["see","看"],["the","这"],["total","全"],["eclipse,","食"],["on","在"],["April","四月"],["8,","8"],["2024.","2024年"]]},{"start":38.1,"end":47.81,"text":"Inside those dark paths are oval shapes with times inside them. People inside the ovals will see the annular eclipse or total eclipse at that time.","words":[["Inside","在里面"],["those","那些"],["dark","深色"],["paths","路径"],["are","是"],["oval","椭圆"],["shapes","形状"],["with","带"],["times","时间"],["inside","在里面"],["them.","它们"],["People","人们"],["inside","在里面"],["the","这"],["ovals","椭圆"],["will","将"],["see","看到"],["the","这"],["annular","环"],["eclipse","食"],["or","或"],["total","全"],["eclipse","食"],["at","在"],["that","那个"],["time.","时间"]]},{"start":48.62,"end":55.79,"text":"Inside each path are white lines that indicate how long annularity or totality will last.","words":[["Inside","在里面"],["each","每条"],["path","路径"],["are","是"],["white","白色"],["lines","线"],["that","那"],["indicate","表示"],["how","多"],["long","长"],["annularity","环食"],["or","或"],["totality","全食"],["will","将"],["last.","持续"]]},{"start":56.66,"end":66.7,"text":"For locations outside the paths,yellow and purple lines running parallel to each path indicate how much of the Sun will become covered by the Moon.","words":[["For","对于"],["locations","地点"],["outside","在外"],["the","这"],["paths,yellow","路径，黄色"],["and","和"],["purple","紫色"],["lines","线"],["running","延伸"],["parallel","平行"],["to","于"],["each","每条"],["path","路径"],["indicate","表示"],["how","多"],["much","多少"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["Sun","太阳"],["will","将"],["become","变得"],["covered","遮住"],["by","被"],["the","这"],["Moon.","月亮"]]},{"start":67.93,"end":74.51,"text":"These paths extend to the edge of the map where percentages for the partial eclipses can be found.","words":[["These","这些"],["paths","路径"],["extend","延伸"],["to","到"],["the","这"],["edge","边缘"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["map","地图"],["where","那里"],["percentages","百分比"],["for","为"],["the","这"],["partial","偏"],["eclipses","食"],["can","能"],["be","被"],["found.","找到"]]},{"start":75.14,"end":82.15,"text":"Percentage labels for the annular eclipse lines appear along the left and top edges of the map.","words":[["Percentage","百分比"],["labels","标签"],["for","为"],["the","这"],["annular","环"],["eclipse","食"],["lines","线"],["appear","显示"],["along","沿着"],["the","这"],["left","左"],["and","和"],["top","上"],["edges","边缘"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["map.","地图"]]},{"start":83.12,"end":90.49,"text":"Percentage labels for the total eclipse appear along the bottom and right edges of the map.","words":[["Percentage","百分比"],["labels","标签"],["for","为"],["the","这"],["total","全"],["eclipse","食"],["appear","显示"],["along","沿着"],["the","这"],["bottom","下"],["and","和"],["right","右"],["edges","边缘"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["map.","地图"]]},{"start":91.42,"end":102.53,"text":"A globe shows the full eclipse paths, and shaded bands show where a partial eclipse can be seen.","words":[["A","一个"],["globe","地球仪"],["shows","显示"],["the","这"],["full","完整"],["eclipse","食"],["paths,","路径"],["and","和"],["shaded","阴影"],["bands","条带"],["show","显示"],["where","哪里"],["a","一个"],["partial","偏"],["eclipse","食"],["can","能"],["be","被"],["seen.","看到"]]}]}